    "context": null,
    "description": {
      "gm": "",
      "value": "<p>Due to failing the Stonewyrm's breath weapon save, you are turning to stone and might become @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.dTwPJuKgBQCMxixg]{Petrified}.</p><p>You must attempt a @Check[fortitude|traits:earth,poison,primal,magical] save at the end of each of your turns. </p><p>On a failed save, your @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.xYTAsEpcJE1Ccni3]{Slowed} condition increases by 1. </p><p>A successful save decreases your Slowed condition by 1. </p><p>If you become fully unable to act due to the Slowed condition, you are petrified permanently.</p><hr /><p><em>For automation purposes, this effect applies Slowed equal to its value. Tick up or down as needed to track Slowed. The level of this effect is equal to the Stonewyrm's level.</em></p>"
    },
